    :amendExisting [Task44002 Task44003]
    :missing "No autonomous rebuild closure or delivered-runtime independence criterion: compiling the evaluator once under C and executing it with wasmtime does not meet the user’s clarified end state."
    :evidence [".asl/mem/tasks/Phase440FullAslSelfHosting.asn:55" ".asl/mem/tasks/Phase440FullAslSelfHosting.asn:57" ".asl/mem/tasks/Phase440FullAslSelfHosting.asn:69" ".asl/mem/tasks/Phase440FullAslSelfHosting.asn:88" "https://webassembly.org/docs/non-web/"]
    :proposal "Extend Task44002/03 with a source-derived compiler-and-runtime rebuild chain and a declared bootstrap/build/deployed dependency boundary, gated first by the currently failing bootstrap-contract check and finally by an offline second-generation rebuild with the seed compiler and external runtime unavailable."
    :gate (:kind :staticPlanContract :cwd "/Users/purplelephant/projects/asex" :command "python3 -c 'from pathlib import Path; import re,sys; paths=sorted(p for p in Path(\".asl/mem/tasks\").glob(\"Phase*.asn\") if re.match(r\"Phase(?:43[6-9]|44[01])\",p.name)); assert len(paths)==6; hits=[(str(p),i,l) for p in paths for i,l in enumerate(p.read_text().splitlines(),1) if re.search(sys.argv[1],l,re.I)]; print(hits); sys.exit(0 if hits else 1)' 'stage[ -]?[23]|fixed[ -]point|compiler.{0,80}compil.{0,30}compiler|rebuild.{0,80}bootstrap'" :baselineExit 1 :executedPredicates 1 :matches 0)
    :acceptance "Stage 0 is an explicit audited seed; stage 1 must compile the compiler and evaluator, and stage 2 must reproduce normalized artifacts or documented semantic equivalence from the same source; the delivered CLI must execute check/test/RPC without invoking wasmtime, Node, JSC or a system compiler, while the WASM module remains testable in an independent conforming host. A runtime still requires a machine/OS or embedding: define that boundary, do not promise execution without any substrate."
    :limits "The executed gate detects absence of an explicit contract in these six plans; it is not a behavioral gate and cannot be made sufficient merely by inserting the keyword. The semantic acceptance must be separately implemented and run before completion.")
