    :proposal "Extend Task44101 with runner-issued receipts bound to session, step, gate and content digests, gated by the currently failing receipt-binding check and then rejection of forged, stale and wrong-step receipts without advancing the ledger."
    :gate (:kind :staticPlanContract :cwd "/Users/purplelephant/projects/asex" :command "python3 -c 'from pathlib import Path; import re,sys; paths=sorted(p for p in Path(\".asl/mem/tasks\").glob(\"Phase*.asn\") if re.match(r\"Phase(?:43[6-9]|44[01])\",p.name)); assert len(paths)==6; hits=[(str(p),i,l) for p in paths for i,l in enumerate(p.read_text().splitlines(),1) if re.search(sys.argv[1],l,re.I)]; print(hits); sys.exit(0 if hits else 1)' '(?:receipt.{0,100}(?:digest|hash|signed|signature)|(?:digest|hash|signature).{0,100}receipt)'" :baselineExit 1 :executedPredicates 1 :matches 0)
    :acceptance "The verifier, not the model, records command identity, exit status, source digest and relevant assertion/mutation outcomes; altering source after testing invalidates the receipt. A digest supplied by the same untrusted caller is not authentication. Use a local trusted runner boundary rather than adding network signing infrastructure."
